  m_icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_elements:
  - guidHash: 540778221
    text: Everyone has gold in their pockets, just gotta beat it out of em.
  - guidHash: -782171836
    text: You found a oddly large toe, seems lucky?
  - guidHash: 622652962
    text: What could go better with a nice refreshing potion?
  - guidHash: 24740854
    text: A lovely warm bath, in what appears to be...cream?
  - guidHash: 1251865343
    text: Nothing is quite as holy as the simple chest.
  - guidHash: 1233549183
    text: Destroy relics for blessings.
  - guidHash: -39074577
    text: At their core, relics are just blessings with extra steps.
  - guidHash: -1770773694
    text: 'The jacket itself is fine, but for some reason, a bunch of the peasents
      here got super weird about me wearing it. '
  - guidHash: -1680524717
    text: 'Curiosity and exploration can rejuvenate the soul. '
  - guidHash: -2000754098
    text: Peasants are issued one pair of boots a year. The boots never last an entire
      year.
  - guidHash: -1840453806
    text: Tasty rainbow
  - guidHash: -650230487
    text: An old explorer once said that gold can be found in hidden places.
  - guidHash: -2139671564
    text: 'The most magic wand in the known world, but also the most fragile. '
  - guidHash: 1918558942
    text: The Emperor shines his light down on you.
  - guidHash: -1655286976
    text: Pilfers are known for stealing gold, but storing it for you, well thats
      new.
  - guidHash: 1670328365
    text: Why would you keep these sharp blades in your pockets? Seems unwise.
  - guidHash: 1874654790
    text: "\u9540\u91D1\u62A4\u624B"
  - guidHash: -1421196385
    text: Worn by Sanctum sculptors to appear regal and powerful, trying to mask
      the philistine lies.
  - guidHash: -615636160
    text: Due fly related accident during its forging, the handle of this massive
      tool is quite a bit shorter than it should be.
  - guidHash: 2111729323
    text: A novelty keychain found on the keys to Black Rabbit's cell.
  - guidHash: 1567832749
    text: Due to a fly related accident during it's forging, the handle of this massive
      tool is quite a bit shorter than it should be.
  - guidHash: -1005969797
    text: 'In the darkness there is light. '
  - guidHash: -1304172307
    text: Sometimes the mines unearth ancient secrets not meant for any being to
      lay their eyes upon. This is one such horror.
  - guidHash: 43963526
    text: 'An ingenious inventor came to the faith late, and made the most of his
      second life. '
  - guidHash: 1860610704
    text: Beltrame creates some wonderful potions, but I do wonder where all the
      waste goes?
  - guidHash: 1732413302
    text: 'A totem depicting an ancient god of life and the natural order. '
  - guidHash: 584029238
    text: 'Normally a healthy lifestyle makes for a healthy body, but peasants make
      due with what they got. '
  - guidHash: -180616374
    text: Hoarding gold has always been a tatic of the wealthy and elite, no wonder
      they seem so powerful.
  - guidHash: -67876275
    text: Every little helps.
  - guidHash: -37702875
    text: The shop holds many secrets, and you've just been let in on one.
  - guidHash: -1536217873
    text: A key that looks like it could open any door.
  - guidHash: -1124808619
    text: Nothing quite says fool like some fool's gold.
  - guidHash: 303701289
    text: 'This Elderseed seems to have mutated, it oozes something that doesn''t
      look very nice. '
  - guidHash: -717052596
    text: These pilfers will shake down anyone who crosses their path if it means
      a little extra gold.
  - guidHash: 232501871
    text: The plague is a familar blight of the peasant and with that comes the rats.
  - guidHash: -1923232017
    text: Nothing quite like helping out a local business.
  - guidHash: 700904090
    text: The best things in life are those that are free!
  - guidHash: -1922036168
    text: A kernel of corn, blessed by a mighty priest who thought it may bring good
      luck to the future harvest.
  - guidHash: 606738836
    text: Plant Leaf
  - guidHash: -754791869
    text: These little leaves look like they are quite edible.
  - guidHash: 276503105
    text: These gold pieces would have prefered to stay lodged with the rocks.
  - guidHash: -439612761
    text: A token of friendship between the pilfers and peasants of Delvemore.
  - guidHash: -1305441280
    text: RIP AND TEAR UNTIL IT IS DONE.
  - guidHash: -1372392542
    text: I wonder who these skulls used to belong to?
  - guidHash: 735039217
    text: 'This thief''s tool bears the engraving of a rabbit. Also, an engraving
      that reads "Black Rabbit''s, hands off!" Further down it also reads "Seriously!" '
  - guidHash: -526797796
    text: Always eat your veggies!
  - guidHash: -923546745
    text: Transmute Statue Cost Increase
  - guidHash: 1983987256
    text: Its too cheap in the base game.
  - guidHash: -754573880
    text: Too much gold in the base game.
  - guidHash: 1192452755
    text: Enemies are too weak in the base game.
  - guidHash: 470154009
    text: Dont take enough damage in the base game.
  - guidHash: -1503613438
    text: HP too high in base game.
  - guidHash: 452927784
    text: 'Strength and Dexterity are too high in the base game. '
  - guidHash: 2135772902
    text: Deals with the devil are never quite worth the price you pay.
  - guidHash: -1065593332
    text: A tasty little leaf.
  - guidHash: -2060143959
    text: Gloves worn by the old guard to ward off evil spirits.
  - guidHash: 1160186849
    text: This candle protects from danger but something about it seems unnatural.
  - guidHash: 1466046654
    text: Wealth, but at what cost?
  - guidHash: 1137579462
    text: Seems like Sho'guul and the shopkeeper made a deal.
  - guidHash: 258623003
    text: Coffee, straight into the veins, all the time.
  - guidHash: -1422381718
    text: Shroud your body in metal so that you may feel no pain.
  - guidHash: -1453147761
    text: No pain no gain.
  - guidHash: 967036207
    text: This gift comes at a cost.
  - guidHash: -2043486611
    text: Food just doesnt taste the same without your special seasoning.
  - guidHash: -48610449
    text: These boots seem strange.
  - guidHash: 208914220
    text: Baggledag has a bounty on his head, will you be the one to claim it?
  - guidHash: 888883818
    text: To desecrate an altar of worship is to laugh in the face of the greater
      powers.
  - guidHash: -527607219
    text: These shockwaves really do pack quite the punch.
  - guidHash: 1495782128
    text: The metal this pickaxe is made from seems strange?
  - guidHash: 289416233
    text: The master's wear these hats to hone their magical powers.
  - guidHash: 1147454776
    text: A force to be reckoned with.
  - guidHash: -1195403896
    text: All donations are welcome. But who is collecting them?
  - guidHash: -391569514
    text: "\u5236\u91D1\u672F"
  - guidHash: -1707543074
    text: "\u91D1\u5757\u843D\u5730\u65F6\u6709\u4E00\u5B9A\u51E0\u7387\u53D8\u6210\u66F4\u5927\u5757\u7684\u91D1\u5757\u3002"
  - guidHash: 1424617820
    text: Chrysopoeia is the art of creating gold from nothing, an endless cycle
      to be repeated.
  - guidHash: 1610991395
    text: "\u63A2\u9669\u4E13\u5BB6"
  - guidHash: -1916633534
    text: "\u79D8\u5BC6\u623F\u95F4\u6709\u4E00\u5B9A\u51E0\u7387\u5305\u542B\u66F4\u591A\u7269\u54C1\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1102772234
    text: These worn papers can still be of some use.
  - guidHash: 682646194
    text: "\u5B8C\u7F8E\u8C03\u548C"
  - guidHash: 91360686
    text: "\u996E\u7528\u836F\u6C34\u65F6\u968F\u673A\u8D4B\u4E88\u4F60\u4E00\u4E2A\u5B9A\u65F6\u7C7B\u836F\u6C34\u7684\u6548\u679C\u3002"
  - guidHash: -726174470
    text: This concoction can be quite deadly if you don't know what you're doing.
  - guidHash: 1380617407
    text: "\u6D1E\u5BDF"
  - guidHash: 983936473
    text: "\u964D\u4F4E\u5965\u6CD5\u88C5\u5907\u7684\u6CD5\u529B\u6D88\u8017\u3002"
  - guidHash: 970320576
    text: Through insight we gain enlightenment.
  - guidHash: 1431548255
    text: "\u8150\u5316\u796D\u575B"
  - guidHash: 836901224
    text: "\u796D\u575B\u989D\u5916\u63D0\u4F9B\u4E00\u4E2A\u8BC5\u5492\uFF0C\u8BE5\u8BC5\u5492\u4F1A\u5728\u5FCF\u6094\u540E\u81EA\u884C\u79FB\u9664\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1225464520
    text: These Altars seem to spew dark light from every crack.
  - guidHash: -1596639059
    text: "\u795E\u5723\u4E4B\u89E6"
  - guidHash: 1159566258
    text: "\u653B\u51FB\u654C\u4EBA\u65F6\u6709\u4E00\u5B9A\u51E0\u7387\u6CBB\u7597\u654C\u4EBA\u3002"
  - guidHash: 127420662
    text: Healing hand are not always the blessing they appear to be.
  - guidHash: 424238075
    text: "\u70B9\u91D1\u624B"
  - guidHash: -1644304591
    text: "\u7269\u7406\u653B\u51FB\u654C\u4EBA\u65F6\u6709\u51E0\u7387\u6572\u51FB\u51FA\u91D1\u5757\u3002"
  - guidHash: -846465979
    text: "\u8FF7\u4F60\u9E64\u5634\u9504"
  - guidHash: -1968013997
    text: "\u5927\u5E45\u63D0\u5347\u673A\u7075\uFF0C\u540C\u65F6\u964D\u4F4E\u653B\u51FB\u8303\u56F4\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1026828664
    text: "\u5939\u5FC3\u4E09\u660E\u6CBB"
  - guidHash: 1281558143
    text: "\u996E\u7528\u836F\u6C34\u65F6\u6062\u590D\u5C11\u91CF\u751F\u547D\u503C\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1108866584
    text: "\u5077\u5077\u602A\u94F6\u884C"
  - guidHash: 1930611847
    text: "\u5927\u5E45\u63D0\u5347\u6240\u6709\u5C5E\u6027\uFF0C\u4F46\u5728\u5546\u5E97\u5B8C\u6210\u4EFB\u4F55\u8D2D\u4E70\u65F6\u4F1A\u7834\u88C2\u3002"
  - guidHash: -377645632
    text: "\u653B\u51FB\u654C\u4EBA\u65F6\u6709\u51E0\u7387\u4F7F\u654C\u4EBA\u9540\u91D1\u3002"
  - guidHash: 1598319772
    text: "\u5F00\u53D1\u8005\u7684\u96E8\u8863"
  - guidHash: -845948562
    text: "\u514D\u75AB\u5143\u7D20\u72B6\u6001\u6548\u679C\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1792935340
    text: "\u9EBB\u75F9\u836F\u6D74"
  - guidHash: -1016801395
    text: "\u88AB\u51FB\u4E2D\u540E\u77ED\u65F6\u95F4\u5185\u83B7\u5F97\u7269\u7406\u4F24\u5BB3\u514D\u75AB\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1769657135
    text: "\u5929\u8D50\u5B9D\u7BB1"
  - guidHash: 479530548
    text: "\u670925%\u7684\u51E0\u7387\u5728\u5B9D\u7BB1\u4E2D\u53D1\u73B0\u4E00\u4E2A\u968F\u673A\u795D\u798F\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1602624992
    text: "\u9ED1\u66DC\u77F3\u9B54\u6756"
  - guidHash: 1609995291
    text: "\u5927\u5E45\u63D0\u5347\u6700\u5927\u6CD5\u529B\uFF0C\u4F46\u53D7\u5230\u4F24\u5BB3\u65F6\u4F1A\u65AD\u88C2\u3002"
  - guidHash: 1088214855
    text: "\u5DE8\u5927\u9E64\u5634\u9504"
  - guidHash: -1459315563
    text: "\u5927\u5E45\u63D0\u5347\u653B\u51FB\u8303\u56F4\u548C\u529B\u91CF\uFF0C\u4F46\u662F\u673A\u7075\u65E0\u6CD5\u8D85\u8FC71\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1671121772
    text: "\u6A61\u76AE\u6CE5\u9550"
  - guidHash: 1089042749
    text: "\u653B\u51FB\u65F6\u6709\u5C0F\u51E0\u7387\u9020\u6210\u5143\u7D20\u4F24\u5BB3\u6548\u679C\u3002"
  - guidHash: 1127976449
    text: "\u56DE\u6536\u5668\u7684\u7B2C\u4E8C\u7248"
  - guidHash: 2024650576
    text: "\u7834\u574F\u5723\u7269\u5BA4\u7684\u5723\u7269\u4EE5\u83B7\u5F97\u795D\u798F\u3002"
  - guidHash: 10095820
    text: "\u5DE8\u4EBA\u811A\u8DBE"
  - guidHash: -1178399722
    text: "\u51FB\u6740\u654C\u4EBA\u65F6\u6709\u4E00\u5B9A\u51E0\u7387\u63D0\u5347\u5E78\u8FD0\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1237065613
    text: "\u950B\u5229\u7684\u53E3\u888B"
  - guidHash: -82024814
    text: "\u5728\u5077\u5077\u602A\u5546\u5E97\u8D2D\u4E70\u65F6\u53D7\u5230\u4F24\u5BB3\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1938340126
    text: "\u8106\u5F31\u7684\u811A"
  - guidHash: -2074747749
    text: "\u8DF3\u8DC3\u65F6\u53D7\u5230\u4F24\u5BB3\u3002"
  - guidHash: -622005679
    text: "\u518D\u751F"
  - guidHash: -1731503541
    text: "\u63A2\u8DEF\u65F6\u6062\u590D\u751F\u547D\u503C\u3002"
  - guidHash: -142455601
    text: "\u5192\u9669\u7CBE\u795E"
  - guidHash: -1649103270
    text: "\u53D1\u73B0\u79D8\u5BC6\u65F6\u83B7\u5F97\u9EC4\u91D1\uFF0C\u83B7\u5F97\u7684\u9EC4\u91D1\u6570\u91CF\u4F1A\u968F\u7740\u5C42\u6570\u63D0\u9AD8\u3002"
  - guidHash: 1448832851
    text: "\u5E1D\u738B\u7684\u9738\u6743"
  - guidHash: -1819620339
    text: "\u7565\u5FAE\u63D0\u5347\u529B\u91CF\u3001\u654F\u6377\u548C\u667A\u529B\u3002"
  - guidHash: 280339030
    text: "\u751F\u547D\u56FE\u817E"
  - guidHash: 1664160250
    text: "\u63A2\u8DEF\u65F6\u6062\u590D6\u70B9\u751F\u547D\u503C\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1540076425
    text: "\u660F\u6697\u62A4\u7B26"
  - guidHash: -962372198
    text: "\u63A2\u8DEF\u65F6\u6839\u636E\u4F60\u7684\u8BC5\u5492\u6570\u91CF\u6309\u6BD4\u4F8B\u6062\u590D\u751F\u547D\u503C\u3002"
  - guidHash: 2047859672
    text: "\u96F7\u516C\u52A9\u6211"
  - guidHash: -19843859
    text: "\u6709\u65F6\u4F1A\u88AB\u95EA\u7535\u51FB\u4E2D\uFF0C\u8D4B\u4E88\u4F60\u4E00\u5C0F\u6BB5\u65F6\u95F4\u7684\u67D0\u4E2A\u968F\u673A\u836F\u6C34\u6548\u679C\u3002"
  - guidHash: 1635371893
    text: "\u795D\u798F\u7206\u7C73\u82B1"
  - guidHash: -101673242
    text: "\u795D\u798F\u843D\u5730\u65F6\uFF0C\u6709\u65F6\u4F1A\u590D\u5236\u5B83\u4EEC\u3002"
  - guidHash: 1145902201
    text: "\u9006\u8F6C\u5668"
  - guidHash: -27869745
    text: "\u5931\u53BB\u7684\u8BC5\u5492\u53D8\u6210\u795D\u798F\u3002"
  - guidHash: 1685269973
    text: "\u74F6\u88C5\u786B\u78FA\u706B"
  - guidHash: -1842885268
    text: "\u8FD1\u6218\u653B\u51FB\u4F1A\u4ECE\u80F8\u90E8\u91CA\u653E\u786B\u78FA\u5149\u675F\uFF0C\u4F46\u62FE\u53D6\u65F6\u51CF\u5C11\u6700\u5927\u751F\u547D\u503C\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1317969372
    text: "\u5F3A\u5065"
  - guidHash: -1467839534
    text: "\u6CBB\u7597\u6548\u679C\u63D0\u9AD8\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1126349855
    text: "\u5F3A\u5316\u9EC4\u91D1"
  - guidHash: -573854356
    text: "\u6839\u636E\u4F60\u62E5\u6709\u7684\u9EC4\u91D1\u6309\u6BD4\u4F8B\u589E\u52A0\u529B\u91CF\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1379132982
    text: "\u8C26\u5351\u7684\u5E2E\u52A9"
  - guidHash: 1865393030
    text: "\u589E\u52A0\u94A5\u5319\u548C\u70B8\u5F39\u53D8\u6210\u66F4\u9AD8\u7EA7\u7684\u94A5\u5319\u548C\u70B8\u5F39\u7684\u6982\u7387\u3002"
  - guidHash: -918760315
    text: "\u5934\u9AA8\u94A5\u5319"
  - guidHash: 785984054
    text: "\u9AB7\u9AC5\u5934\u53EF\u4EE5\u5F53\u4F5C\u94A5\u5319\u4F7F\u7528\u3002"
  - guidHash: 330009733
    text: "\u5077\u5077\u602A\u4F1A\u5458\u5361"
  - guidHash: 1978834012
    text: "\u4E3A\u5546\u5E97\u6DFB\u52A0\u79D8\u5BC6\u5546\u5E97\u5165\u53E3\u3002"
  - guidHash: 111030044
    text: "\u4F18\u60E0\u5238"
  - guidHash: -929206894
    text: "\u5728\u5546\u5E97\u6BCF\u6B21\u8D2D\u4E70\u540E\uFF0C\u9B45\u529B\u4F1A\u63D0\u53471-3\u3002"
  - guidHash: 894832681
    text: "\u514D\u8D39\u8D60\u54C1"
  - guidHash: -1782761348
    text: "\u4E3A\u6BCF\u4E2A\u5546\u5E97\u6DFB\u52A0\u514D\u8D39\u836F\u6C34\u3002"
  - guidHash: 275310752
    text: "\u611A\u4EBA\u91D1"
  - guidHash: 1257618839
    text: "\u9EC4\u91D1\u843D\u5730\u65F6\u6709\u65F6\u4F1A\u7834\u88C2\u3002"
  - guidHash: -95907248
    text: "\u53D8\u5F02\u6CD5\u529B"
  - guidHash: -1086066309
    text: "\u63A2\u8DEF\u65F6\u6D88\u8017\u6CD5\u529B\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1782119105
    text: "\u5F3A\u76D7\u5077\u5077\u602A"
  - guidHash: 1239495119
    text: "\u649E\u5230\u5077\u5077\u602A\u65F6\u6D88\u8017\u9EC4\u91D1\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1254073212
    text: "\u673A\u667A\u5927\u9F20"
  - guidHash: -24385517
    text: "\u5C06\u5077\u5077\u602A\u66FF\u6362\u4E3A\u8001\u9F20\uFF0C\u5E76\u5728\u6BCF\u4E2A\u6218\u6597\u623F\u95F4\u751F\u6210\u4E00\u4E2A\u9F20\u5DE2"
  - guidHash: 814718738
    text: "\u7F8E\u5473\u852C\u83DC"
  - guidHash: 1774883278
    text: "\u6709\u65F6\u690D\u7269\u4F1A\u6389\u843D\u5177\u6709\u6CBB\u7597\u6548\u679C\u7684\u53F6\u5B50\u3002"
  - guidHash: -222001710
    text: "\u89E3\u9664\u9677\u9631\u5DE5\u5177\u5305"
  - guidHash: 293970505
    text: "\u8FDB\u5165\u65B0\u623F\u95F4\u65F6\u6467\u6BC1\u6240\u6709\u9677\u9631\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1584570444
    text: "\u788E\u9885\u8005"
  - guidHash: -1827855000
    text: "\u62FE\u53D6\u9AB7\u9AC5\u5934\u65F6\u63D0\u5347\u6700\u5927\u751F\u547D\u503C\u3002"
  - guidHash: 1305870854
    text: "\u719F\u7EC3\u730E\u624B"
  - guidHash: 792968762
    text: "\u51FB\u6740\u654C\u4EBA\u65F6\u63D0\u5347\u4E3B\u8981\u5C5E\u6027\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1675605753
    text: "\u80FD\u591F\u5438\u6536\u9EC4\u91D1\uFF0C\u5E76\u5728\u5546\u5E97\u4E2D\u4EAB\u53D720%\u7684\u6298\u6263\u3002"
  - guidHash: 93597975
    text: "\u5BB3\u6015\u7684\u91D1\u5757"
  - guidHash: -1283686459
    text: "\u4F7F\u9EC4\u91D1\u96BE\u4EE5\u62FE\u53D6\u3002"
  - guidHash: -2016421984
    text: "\u53D7\u818F\u624B\u5957"
  - guidHash: -241110271
    text: "\u6839\u636E\u4F60\u7684\u795D\u798F\u79CD\u7C7B\u6570\u91CF\u6309\u6BD4\u4F8B\u589E\u52A0\u654F\u6377\u3002"
  - guidHash: 779550364
    text: "\u8BC5\u5492\u795D\u798F"
  - guidHash: 590336404
    text: "\u83B7\u5F97\u8BC5\u5492\u65F6\uFF0C\u6389\u843D\u4E00\u4EFD\u5F53\u524D\u6700\u4F4E\u7B49\u7EA7\u7684\u795D\u798F\u3002"
  - guidHash: -85737731
    text: "\u8BC5\u5492\u8D22\u5BCC"
  - guidHash: 430377920
    text: "\u83B7\u5F978000\u9EC4\u91D1\uFF0C\u4EE5\u53CA\u4E00\u4E2A\u968F\u673A\u7C98\u9ECF\u8BC5\u5492\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1643393907
    text: "\u6076\u9B54\u6298\u6263"
  - guidHash: -831717502
    text: "\u5728\u5546\u5E97\u4E2D\u4EAB\u53D770%\u7684\u6298\u6263\u3002\u4F46\u5728\u5546\u5E97\u6BCF\u5B8C\u62103\u6B21\u8D2D\u4E70\uFF0C\u5C31\u4F1A\u83B7\u5F97\u4E00\u4E2A\u8BC5\u5492\u3002"
  - guidHash: -1263866586
    text: "\u6EF4\u6EE4\u5496\u5561"
  - guidHash: -396181352
    text: "\u63D0\u5347\u901F\u5EA6\u548C\u673A\u7075\u3002"
  - guidHash: -450620636
    text: "\u75DB\u5E76\u5FEB\u4E50"
  - guidHash: -564606197
    text: "\u5FCF\u6094\u540E\u80FD\u591F\u5C06\u4E0B\u4E00\u6B21\u4F24\u5BB3\u8F6C\u5316\u4E3A\u6CBB\u7597\u3002"
  - guidHash: -2145972307
    text: "\u94F6\u69A8\u6C41\u673A"
